# Environment. Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed value into the browser bundle,
# so treat what goes in here as shipped-to-the-client -- and keep the file out
# of git regardless. Plain `.env` was not covered before, only `*.local`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

